  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Yan clan, when a subordinate reports that little beast king killed Tie Ba Xiu, young master Yan Jun almost does not dare believe it. He asks who little beast king is, having never heard of him. The subordinate says Yan Jun entered an Immemorial Era phantom path inheritance and was in closed cultivation for five years, so not knowing Fang Yuan under that name is normal, and that Fang Zheng is a demonic path rising star of only about twenty.",
      "chapters": [
        364
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_yan_clan",
        "char_tie_ba_xiu",
        "evt_era_immemorial",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the three kings blessed land Fang Yuan weighs whom to subdue with rank five slavery Gu and lists Yan Jun among rank four Gu Masters still present, alongside Yi Huo, Kong Ri Tian, Long Qing Tian, Yi Chong, and others.",
      "chapters": [
        387
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-advance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_slavery_gu",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_yi_huo",
        "char_kong_ri_tian",
        "char_long_qing_tian",
        "char_yi_chong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the great dog-army battle he moves slowly and steadily like a casual traveller. A dog king pounces; he turns into a hollow shadow, the dog king passes through, then he returns to flesh while the dog engages others behind him.",
      "chapters": [
        393
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-advance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that among many rank four Gu Masters, the young clan leader of Yan clan, Yan Jun, is the one who can charge to the bronze hall at that time. He obtained the ancient phantom path inheritance and specializes in hiding and attacking. Fang Yuan recalls that in his previous life phantom path Yan Jun showed great brilliance at Yi Tian mountain until Mo Wu Tian beat him into retreating.",
      "chapters": [
        395
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "phantom-path-and-main-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_mo_wu_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Ning Bing later gives way for Yan Jun to probe Fang Yuan; Feng Tian Yu being sent out proves the land spirit has died.",
      "chapters": [
        396
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "phantom-path-and-main-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_feng_tian_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later push Yan Jun uses a phantom path Gu worm, turning into a hollow shadow and evading again and again, safe and sound.",
      "chapters": [
        403
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "phantom-path-and-main-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He calmly steps into the main hall during the Immortal Gu refinement uproar, and Tie Ruo Nan treats his arrival as proof others will not be far.",
      "chapters": [
        404
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "phantom-path-and-main-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_tie_ruo_nan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, a phantom path inheritor, Yan clan’s young clan leader Yan Jun, sneaks in, kills Chou Jiu, and swaggers off. Chou Jiu then secretly resurrects with remnant life Gu. In the sixth battle Mo Wu Tian’s might defeats Yan Jun into heavy injuries.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chou_jiu"
      ]
    }
  ],
